                     <display value="Hospital course note"/>
                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the hospital course of your 85-year-old female patient, admitted on 19/11/2021 with an acute exacerbation of her known chronic obstructive pulmonary disease. On admission, she presented with increased dyspnoea, productive cough, and reduced oxygen saturation. Diagnostic workup included chest X-ray, arterial blood gas analysis, pulse oximetry, and blood tests, confirming an infective exacerbation with hypoxaemia. She was treated with nebulised bronchodilators, systemic corticosteroids, supplemental oxygen therapy, and intravenous fluids. Her condition improved satisfactorily, with stabilisation of oxygen saturations and reduction in breathlessness. She is discharged home with a tapering course of oral prednisolone and optimised inhaler therapy. Please arrange follow-up within two weeks. Do not hesitate to contact me should you require further information. Yours sincerely, Dr. [Treating Physician]</div>
               </text>
